@host = http://localhost:5088

### List open claims
GET {{host}}/claims?status=Submitted

### File a new claim
# @name create
POST {{host}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-777001",
  "description": "Kitchen fire damaged cabinets",
  "claimedAmount": 5200.50,
  "incidentDate": "2026-11-02"
}

### Validate 'incidentDate not in future'
# @name create
POST {{host}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-777001",
  "description": "Kitchen fire damaged cabinets",
  "claimedAmount": 5200.50,
  "incidentDate": "2027-11-02"
}

### Validate 'incidentDate can be too far in the past'
# @name create
POST {{host}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-777001",
  "description": "Kitchen fire damaged cabinets",
  "claimedAmount": 5200.50,
  "incidentDate": "2020-11-02"
}

### Approve the claim we just created
POST {{host}}/claims/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Fire report attached" }

### Reject without a reason (watch what happens)
POST {{host}}/claims/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "" }

### Integration test
# @name create
POST {{host}}/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-123456",
  "description": "Water leak in the bathroom ceiling",
  "ClaimedAmount": 900.00,
  "incidentDate": "2026-11-05"
}